    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Van v. Vamp is a break-neck comedy revenge FPS about rescuing your wife from an army of creepy vampire suitors that are still in love with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stakes, shotguns, holy water, cursed talking swords, and a whole lotta garlic to rescue your wife Imogen from the wicked Count and his entourage, the Fanged Five.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go, Helsing. It's up to you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wait, what?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, that's right. The vampires are all in love with you. <i>That's uncomfortable.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not because they're not beautiful or anything -- but you are a married man, after all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I mean, Van Helsing<i> is</i>\u00a0quite the catch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quash\u00a0poor pathetic Vamps with a variety of Victorian weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-voiced short story campaign (with a talking sword companion).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bust through shortcuts and rack up kills as you race to get the shortest time possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets, destroy cabbages for power-ups, and blast-dash Vamps away with powerful stake shotguns &amp; silver-bullet shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood-sucking original soundtrack by Daniel Millard (10 Dead Doves).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME FROM THE CREATORS OF 10 DEAD DOVES</h2></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Van v. Vamp is a break-neck comedy revenge FPS about rescuing your wife from an army of creepy vampire suitors that are still in love with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stakes, shotguns, holy water, cursed talking swords, and a whole lotta garlic to rescue your wife Imogen from the wicked Count and his entourage, the Fanged Five.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Go, Helsing. It's up to you.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wait, what?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, that's right. The vampires are all in love with you. <i>That's uncomfortable.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not because they're not beautiful or anything -- but you are a married man, after all.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I mean, Van Helsing<i> is</i>\u00a0quite the catch.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quash\u00a0poor pathetic Vamps with a variety of Victorian weapons. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully-voiced short story campaign (with a talking sword companion).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bust through shortcuts and rack up kills as you race to get the shortest time possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover secrets, destroy cabbages for power-ups, and blast-dash Vamps away with powerful stake shotguns &amp; silver-bullet shooters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood-sucking original soundtrack by Daniel Millard (10 Dead Doves).</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME FROM THE CREATORS OF 10 DEAD DOVES</h2></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "You are Van Helsing. The army of Vamps have kidnapped your wife -- because they're in love with *you*. Kill them all.",
